	(text "STAGES (runoffgroove Condor, JFET gain stage omitted):\nR58/R59/R18 + C36/C38(+C21): bridged-T notch ~400 Hz (Jensen P10R dip); R18 also gives the +6 dB HF shelf and biases U10A.\nC41/C42/R60/R61 + U10B: Sallen-Key HP, f0 ~80 Hz, Q 1.18 (cab low-end rolloff + ~95 Hz bump).\nR62-R65/C43-C46 + U10C/U10D: two Sallen-Key LPs, f0 3.66 kHz, Q 0.99 each (peak ~2.6 kHz, steep top cut)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.924 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bed9bb08-7008-4cf4-92f4-d28438aed46e")
	)
	(text "BUILD OPTIONS:\nNotch depth: stock C36 1n / C38 15n.  Shallower: 1n5 / 10n.  Much shallower (Marshall): 2n2 / 6n8.\nMarshall voicing: + R61 12k, R60 120k, R62-R65 16k (15k/18k), C44/C46 4n7.  Bass: C41/C42 56n-68n more, 33n-39n less.  Treble: R62-R65 18k more, 27k less.\nU10 alt: OPA4197IPW (same pinout, 1 mA/ch) - but its input-pair handover sits at (V+)-3 V = VMID+1.6 V, inside the signal swing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 171.704 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c4ba9029-4a32-482a-ba02-8c38f7f36dbd")
	)
